# Unicode CLDR 47, cldr-json cldr-dates-full/main/mt/ca-gregorian.json. days.format.wide "Il-Ġimgħa", from the Arabic name of the day of
# gathering.  The bare "ġimgħa" is NOT shipped here: without the article it is
# the noun "week", which this locale ships as its week unit.  The articled
# surface stays ambiguous in real Maltese -- "il-ġimgħa" is both "the Friday"
# and "the week" -- and the weekday reading is the one this locale takes.
il-ġimgħa
